<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2895" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκαμπ-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unbent, rigid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				2
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				74b
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἄ</span>. <i>the
				part that will not bend</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				493b29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>unbending, unflinching</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.72
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὰν ἄ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μένει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					455
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πρὸς τοὺς πόνους, τὸ
				εἰς ἐπιείκειαν ἄ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>from which there is no return</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶρος ἐνέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.467
				</span></i>
			 (Antip.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(7).449
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>).</div>
